 "disrupt": "<h3>Something came up</h3><p class=\"ld-muted\">Nothing here counts against you. Life Director only moves what it has to.</p><details class=\"ld-details\" open=\"\"><summary>Called into work or an extra commitment</summary><div class=\"ld-grid2\"><label>Date<input type=\"date\" id=\"dDate\" value=\"2026-10-28\"></label><label>Travel each way (min)<input type=\"number\" id=\"dCommute\" value=\"0\" min=\"0\" step=\"5\"></label></div><div class=\"ld-grid2\"><label>From<input type=\"time\" id=\"dStart\" value=\"17:00\"></label><label>Until<input type=\"time\" id=\"dEnd\" value=\"21:00\"></label></div><button class=\"ld-btn\" data-act=\"dWork\">Add and re-plan</button></details><details class=\"ld-details\"><summary>Lose the next few hours</summary><div class=\"ld-row\"><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dBlock\" data-v=\"1\">1h</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dBlock\" data-v=\"2\">2h</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dBlock\" data-v=\"3\">3h</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dBlock\" data-v=\"4\">4h</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dBlock\" data-v=\"6\">6h</button></div></details><details class=\"ld-details\"><summary>Today is a write-off</summary><button class=\"ld-btn\" data-act=\"dDay\">Clear the rest of today</button></details><details class=\"ld-details\"><summary>I’m sick</summary><div class=\"ld-row\"><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dSick\" data-v=\"1\">1 day</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dSick\" data-v=\"2\">2 days</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dSick\" data-v=\"3\">3 days</button></div><p class=\"ld-muted\">Demanding sessions are cleared and only must-do work is moved to after you recover.</p></details><details class=\"ld-details\"><summary>Energy check-in</summary><div class=\"ld-row\"><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dEnergy\" data-v=\"LOW\">Running low</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dEnergy\" data-v=\"NORMAL\">Normal</button><button class=\"ld-btn ld-small\" data-act=\"dEnergy\" data-v=\"HIGH\">Full of energy</button></div><p class=\"ld-muted\">Adjusts estimates for the next several hours, then fades out.</p></details>",
